# Trivy Configuration Ignore Rules
# Format: <target>:<severity>:<rule>:<message>

# Example entries (uncomment and customize as needed):
# Dockerfile:CRITICAL:CA-001:Avoid using latest tags
# package.json:MEDIUM:CVE-2023-XXXX:Description of vulnerability

# Note: This file should be maintained and reviewed regularly
# as part of the supply chain security process.
